__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
*.db

# Local environment files. Added s577 after a hardcoded credential incident:
# these were NOT ignored in either public repo, while the docs instruct
# operators to create a .env. Push protection is now on, but an ignore rule is
# the cheaper guard because it prevents the staging, not just the push.
# .env.example is deliberately exempt: it is documentation, not a secret.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
